      <activity id="476bb395-b72d-5495-8156-97a88b42194c" activityNameId="330487f0-10a1-5fd8-b6b5-be8bbbb00f3d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal of heat distribution system, apartment building</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal of heat distribution system, apartment building
Disposal of components for the heat distribution system;
UUID: 7bbf0628-589a-427a-9983-7c56bc68996d
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on average input from different call of bids for the heating system used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7bbf0628-589a-427a-9983-7c56bc68996d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
